It will work, but probably is a bit of overkill.  Throwing 2-3 gems
at a co-aligned unicorn is usually enough to max out your luck.
With a blessed/uncursed luckstone it will stay there.

Sacrificing non-aligned unicorns doesn't really improve your luck
(unless you get a four-leaf clover), but does improve your alignment
more than a normal monster would.
